    '**`L3`, the whole slide:** **Corynebacterium diphtheriae** · **respiratory droplet** spread · **prevention by vaccination (DPT)** · **thick grey TRUE membrane** · **extreme bilateral cervical LN swelling (BULL NECK)** · the **exotoxin** causes **low-grade fever**, sore throat, **breathing difficulties** · can cause **skin sores and rash** · treatment **isolation and hospital care + antitoxin (start early) + antibiotics**.',
